---
title: "Numerical Control III"
code: "MAC-123"
category: "machine-technology"
credits: "3"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/MAC-121"
corequisites: []
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisite: MAC 121, 122"
---

Focuses on numerical control techniques in metal forming and machine processes. Includes theory and practice in lathe and milling machine computer numerical control program writing, setup and operation. Lecture 2 hours, Laboratory 3 hours, Total 5 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
